{"id":"W2bc5ea09076f9ce93fc4bdef","zh":"概率转换","en":"","name":"概率转换","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"Cdfc6fd5e7be02b7b2cab","families":[],"definition_zh":"文中将激励的概率信息传递为系统响应概率信息的处理过程。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"在车辆—轨道系统的随机激励分析中，通过动力计算与统计分析建立激励概率和响应概率之间的联系，用于将激振源的概率信息传递到系统响应端。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W2bc5ea09076f9ce93fc4bdef","text":"概率转换","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Se3e99591a764df5207d3","source_id":"P114","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"通过车辆-轨道系统激振源随机分析,论证系统激振源与系统随机响应之间的概率转换关系;采用激振源时-空随机分析方法,可以获取系统在不同概率水平下的振动响应;将构架蛇形波作为车轨系统横向激振源计算系统响应极值具有一定的可行性。","citations":[{"source_id":"P114","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Scf7c1b2a65a99a3d9990","source_id":"P114","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"此吻合是指此系统响应的全概率吻合,该计算结果说明: (1)此系统激振源与其振动响应之间存在概率转换关系,例如轨道随机不平顺与构架蛇形响应存在的概率转换关系,此关系可通过车辆-轨道耦合动力学 [1] 理论计算和统计分析获得。","citations":[{"source_id":"P114","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"sources":{"P114":{"id":"P114","title":"车辆-轨道系统激振源随机分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.04.017","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-random-analysis-on-vibration-sources-of-train-track-system"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"通过动力计算与统计分析联系激励概率和响应概率。","language":"zh","source_id":"P114","paper_slug":"2018-random-analysis-on-vibration-sources-of-train-track-system","title":"车辆－轨道系统激振源随机分析","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W43cceb146975e0d1514e2f7d","name":"probabilistic transformation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W43cceb146975e0d1514e2f7d","name":"probabilistic transformation","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cr